  "change_note": "Paired to merged Core #386 main 849e4a08; exact main Core Quality 40438813363 succeeded. Runtime schema and both component manifests come from this same frozen commit. Bridge v1.1, occurrence v1.2, fixtures, Pi/PiDurable 1.0.2 and the 12 public Bridge commands remain unchanged. Ordinary Runtime preserves Main1 and uses normal-v3 for already activated, owner-authenticated Main3 without implicit migration or a Desktop scheduler. Streaming owner history accepts null capacity limits without changing Goal or model budgets. Current-source recall retains scope and deletion fences. macOS native visible PDF/PNG/JPEG sources use Core-owned bounded helpers; image text requires a separate explicit confirmation before schedule adoption or G1 source review. DOCX/ICS remain supported; file updates/cancel/pairing/timetable and unsupported Bridge capabilities remain held. Upload is read-only proposal delivery, never automatic adoption or preparation. Grants, captured-prompt receipts, recipient confirmation, feedback lineage and consent-bound local usage remain enforced. No real data migration, external sends, collection activation or claim of signed/installed validation."
